		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Support ticket triage (Ask Questions)\n\nOne Jev request per ticket answers **three questions at once**:\n- **department** (Choice): billing / technical / sales, plus `department_confidence`\n- **frustration** (Score): 0 = calm to 2 = very angry, plus `frustration_level`\n- **is_urgent** (Noul): probability of yes, 0–1\n\nThe IF node then decides in the workflow, not in the model: urgent (≥ 0.8) or very angry (≥ 1.5) → P1.\n\nSelect your **Jev credential** on the Jev node, then click **Execute workflow**.",
				"width": 700,
				"height": 340
			},
			"id": "c2984f4c-ce06-4084-8f1a-988bbbe02d66",
			"name": "Sticky Note 5f8f",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-40,
